            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a gonadotropin-releasing hormone antagonist, which has an antagonistic activity against gonadotropin-releasing hormone and can be used for the prevention or treatment of a sex hormone-dependent disease, such as benign prostatic hypertrophy, hysteromyoma, endometriosis, metrofibroma, precocious puberty, amenorrhea, premenstrual syndrome, or dysmenorrhea, or a prodrug thereof, or a pharmaceutically acceptable salt thereof, or a hydrate or solvate thereof, and a pharmaceutical composition comprising the same.</p>
            </abstract>
